    "citation": "Killgore WDS, Balkin TJ, Yarnell AM, Capaldi VF II. Sleep deprivation impairs recognition of specific emotions. Neurobiology of Sleep and Circadian Rhythms 2017;3:10-16. doi:10.1016/j.nbscr.2017.01.001 (PMID 31236499, PMCID PMC6575584).",
