    "design": "Within-subject experiment: 54 healthy young adults (29 M, 25 F) classified 120 morphed facial expressions (20 per basic emotion) on the Ekman Hexagon Test after a normal night of sleep, after one night of total sleep deprivation (23.5 h awake), and after 12 h recovery sleep",
